+# Plain HTTP for Internal Hosts
+
+This project's currently recorded decision is an HTTPS-everywhere policy: all connections must use HTTPS, no plaintext connection exceptions are permitted, and this requirement applies uniformly across all configurations and deployment environments — so plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts either.
